}

params:query {
  ~page: capaian
  ~active_only: true
}

docs {
  # List Carousel (Public)
  
  ## API Endpoint
  `GET /api/carousel`
  
  **Auth Required:** ❌ Public
  
  ---
  
  ## DTO (Query Parameters)
  
  ```typescript
  interface ListCarouselQuery {
    page?: string;        // Filter halaman: "capaian" | "home"
    active_only?: boolean; // Default: true
  }
  ```
  
  | Param | Type | Required | Default |
  |-------|------|----------|---------|
  | page | string | ❌ | "capaian" |
  | active_only | boolean | ❌ | true |
  
  ---
  
  ## Response Structure
  
  ### Success (200 OK)
  ```json
  {
    "success": true,
    "message": "Berhasil mengambil data carousel",
    "data": [
      {
        "id": "uuid",
        "title": "Banner Penelitian 2025",
        "image_url": "/uploads/carousel/banner1.jpg",
        "is_active": true,
        "page": "capaian",
        "order": 1
      }
    ]
  }
  ```
}
